{"id": "court-judicial-benefit-reimbursement", "title": "A payroll code left San Francisco’s court paying $241,620 in county benefits", "seconds": 41.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "25f42efbad737425", "words": 134, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In fiscal 2007, San Francisco handled payroll for its local trial court.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.71, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "paid?"], "sub": "Local health costs were charged to the state trial court"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.54, 0.73, 1.12, 1.72, 1.98, 2.54, 2.85, 3.27, 3.42, 3.58, 3.9, 4.2]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A payroll code sent county health costs to the court.", "t0": 4.83, "t1": 7.3, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "index", "layout": "table", "heading": "The payroll indices", "context": "City FAMIS", "rows": [{"label": "Judges", "value": "118113"}, {"label": "County", "value": "115012"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.55, 0.84, 1.08, 1.4, 1.62, 1.91, 2.02, 2.13]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Court paid $241,620 over two fiscal years.", "t0": 7.52, "t1": 11.91, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "amount", "layout": "table", "heading": "Benefit costs", "context": "Fiscal year", "rows": [{"label": "FY2006–07", "value": "$107,958"}, {"label": "FY2007–08", "value": "$133,662"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.35, 0.58, 0.83, 1.12, 1.64, 2.05, 2.28, 2.54, 2.81, 3.2, 3.42, 3.64, 4.01]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Health, dependent coverage and dental coverage made up that total.", "t0": 12.03, "t1": 15.19, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "amount", "layout": "table", "heading": "Coverage types", "context": "Two years", "rows": [{"label": "Health", "value": "$132,483"}, {"label": "Dependent", "value": "$34,461"}, {"label": "Dental", "value": "$74,676"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.9, 1.3, 1.43, 1.76, 2.17, 2.39, 2.55, 2.75]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Court reported that recovery began in October 2009.", "t0": 15.31, "t1": 18.8, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "court", "kicker": "The Court reported starting recovery on October 1, 2009", "text": "Recovery started", "mark": "Recovery"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 0.79, 0.97, 1.47, 1.87, 2.01, 2.51, 2.71, 3.12]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditors also asked about collecting the old balance.", "t0": 18.92, "t1": 21.56, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "court", "kicker": "The Court reported starting recovery on October 1, 2009", "text": "Earlier balance", "mark": "Earlier"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.62, 0.97, 1.19, 1.43, 1.87, 2.0, 2.2]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "City records show different amounts in a judges’ health account.", "t0": 21.78, "t1": 24.57, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "accounts", "kicker": "The public spending data cannot settle the historical balance", "text": "City account", "mark": "City"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.71, 0.96, 1.28, 1.62, 1.74, 1.82, 2.19, 2.42]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "By fiscal 2010 that account showed just $85.21.", "t0": 24.69, "t1": 28.97, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "accounts", "kicker": "The public spending data cannot settle the historical balance", "text": "Health Payments - Judges", "mark": "Health"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.55, 0.87, 1.15, 1.32, 1.69, 1.97, 2.22, 2.84, 3.21, 3.32, 3.85]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The spending data also covers other employees in the system.", "t0": 29.09, "t1": 32.02, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "accounts", "kicker": "The public spending data cannot settle the historical balance", "text": "Other accounts", "mark": "Other"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.48, 0.79, 1.18, 1.56, 1.8, 2.28, 2.38, 2.48]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "An actual receipt would show whether the City settled that bill.", "t0": 32.14, "t1": 35.13, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "accounts", "kicker": "The public spending data cannot settle the historical balance", "text": "The City receipt", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.49, 0.84, 1.01, 1.28, 1.58, 1.73, 2.08, 2.44, 2.65]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The public figures cannot tell us whether the earlier balance was repaid.", "t0": 35.25, "t1": 38.73, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The missing receipt"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.45, 0.8, 1.17, 1.42, 1.54, 1.86, 2.01, 2.4, 2.74, 2.9]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.85, "t1": 40.96, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Local health costs were charged to the state trial court", "b": "The Court had paid $241,620 across two fiscal years", "o": "The public spending data cannot settle the historical balance"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "contrast"}